{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1064003001:0":{"text":"겨우 해치웠네... 껍질이 너무 단단해서 폭발 마법도 잘 안 먹혔어...","source_cn":"总算解决了……沙虫铠甲好硬，爆炸魔法竟然都伤不到它……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5B46363BCA87CB3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064003002:1":{"text":"저건 우리 아센 사막의 왕인 사나스투스니까.","source_cn":"毕竟是我们荒角沙漠的沙王——萨纳斯潘特。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9AA036FAC3B51C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064003003:1":{"text":"전설적인 몬스터라고 봐야지!","source_cn":"也算是传说级别的怪物了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1AF09129948ED766","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064003004:1":{"text":"멋진 이름이네. 나중에 이름 지을 때 참고해야겠어.","source_cn":"好厉害的名字，可以记下来当命名参考。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB525689A1E1CFE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064003005:1":{"text":"...대체 그런 이름을 지어서 뭐에 쓸 건데.","source_cn":"……什么东西才会用到这种名字啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4FF1ECA200EEE442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064003006:1":{"text":"인사를 아직 못 했네, 안녕!","source_cn":"嘿，你们好！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6CF25B43D049DD55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064003007:1":{"text":"난 아르사. 얘는 소렌! 우리는 우르 부족이야.","source_cn":"我是阿尔萨，他是索恩！我们来自乌尔氏族！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3A3775674741BDC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064003008:1":{"text":"멀린, 오랜만이야. 이쪽은 네 새로운 동료들이야?","source_cn":"梅林大人，好久不见！他们是你的新同伴吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xA169B288CEC631ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1064003008":{"text":"멀린, 오랜만이야. 이쪽은 네 새로운 동료들이야?","source_cn":"梅林大人，好久不见！他们是你的新同伴吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xA169B288CEC631ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064003009:1":{"text":"우와, 다른 세계에서 왔어? 엄청 멋지네! 미궁이랑 다양한 마물이라니...","source_cn":"哇！另一个世界也太酷了！有迷宫和各种魔物啊……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC3BF317A9A000D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064003010:1":{"text":"아센 사막에는 무슨 일이야?","source_cn":"你们怎么会来荒角沙漠？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xABE93E157D272C2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064003011:1":{"text":"고대 생물의 뼈를 찾으러 왔어. 그걸로 돌아갈 방법을 찾을 수 있을지도 모르거든.","source_cn":"我们来找远古生物骨骼，有了它说不定我们就能回去了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA929E05933B18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064003012:1":{"text":"그럼 잘 왔네! 우리가 제일 오래된 뼈가 있는 곳을 알아. 그렇지, 소렌?","source_cn":"那你们真是来对地方啦！我们知道哪里有最古老的骨骼，对吧...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064003013:1":{"text":"응. 아버지가 이야기해 주신 적이 있어.","source_cn":"嗯，老爹提过。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3A30A33452320430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064003014:1":{"text":"그럼 흩어지자. 뼈가 있는 곳은 내가 알려줄게. 소렌은...","source_cn":"既然如此，我们分头行动。我带你们去找骨骼！索恩——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x24251A47C32299BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1064003014":{"text":"그럼 흩어지자. 뼈가 있는 곳은 내가 알려줄게. 소렌은...","source_cn":"既然如此，我们分头行动。我带你们去找骨骼！索恩——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x24251A47C32299BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064003015:1":{"text":"그럼 우리 촌락에 가서 쉬면서 모래 벌레나 먹어보자!","source_cn":"那就先跟我们回部落里休整吧，正好尝尝这个大沙虫！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFEB9F03D07549C40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064003016:1":{"text":"하지만... 맛은 보장 못해! 우리도 모래 벌레로 요리해 본 적이 없어서 말이야...","source_cn":"呃，不保证味道！因为我们也是第一次吃……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7CED5A4E81F36F9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064003017:0":{"text":"먹어본 적이 없다고? 자주 먹는 줄 알았는데.","source_cn":"你们没有吃过吗？我还以为这是这里常见的食物。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xED70AF30AAB4FF79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064003018:1":{"text":"아냐. 모래 벌레는 잡기 힘들어서 평소에는 그냥 피해 다녀.","source_cn":"不是啦，沙虫很难打的。一般我们都是躲着走。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF9468BC9608D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064003019:1":{"text":"하지만 요즘 모래 벌레의 짝짓기 철이라도 되는 모양인지...","source_cn":"但最近似乎是沙虫的求偶期……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8270F3038493B055","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064003020:0":{"text":"활동 범위도 넓어지고 사나워졌어!","source_cn":"它的活动范围和脾气都变大了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4E819A1DA6D60380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064003021:0":{"text":"너희가 있어서 다행이지, 아니었으면 큰 사고가 일어날 뻔했어!","source_cn":"幸亏有你们在，不然我们肯定遭殃啦！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAE13735E0F5278FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064003022:0":{"text":"해가 점점 뜨거워지니까, 걸으면서 이야기하자.","source_cn":"日头越来越大了，边走边说。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE60BD5F5514876C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:31:1064003023:1":{"text":"우리는 힘을 합쳐 거대한 모래 벌레를 우르 부족의 오아시스로 옮겼고, 센시와 라이오스는 한참동안 모래 벌레를 관찰했다","source_cn":"你们合力将巨大的沙虫运回了乌尔氏族的绿洲。森西和莱欧斯...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064003024:1":{"text":"정말 특이한 생물이네. 사막에 사는데 껍데기는 바다에 사는 갑각류 같아.","source_cn":"真是奇特的生物，生活在沙漠，但是外壳结构却像是甲壳类的...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064003025:1":{"text":"그렇다면 껍질 사이로 칼을 찔러 넣어야겠군. 어디 보자...","source_cn":"那么，根据结构得在甲壳接缝处下刀，老夫先试试看……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x44C096E23863C40C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064003026:1":{"text":"센시는 능숙하게 껍질 사이를 따라 칼로 단단한 모래 벌레 껍질을 천천히 벗겨냈다.","source_cn":"森西沿着接缝巧妙地切割后，慢慢剥开了沙虫坚硬的外壳。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x57B7D25C60A58833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064003027:1":{"text":"와! 안에 흰 살이 있어!","source_cn":"哇！里面竟然是白色的肉！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x42CABC864566A6C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064003028:1":{"text":"엄청 연해 보이네!","source_cn":"而且看起来好鲜嫩！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7C6434AD919BB9DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064003029:1":{"text":"육질이 단단하네. 음... 아마도 빠르게 이동하는 습성 때문이겠지.","source_cn":"肉质看起来也很紧实。唔，或许跟它经常高速移动有关。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF55739E9A3C65E82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064003030:1":{"text":"맛은 어떨까?","source_cn":"就是不知道尝起来什么味道？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1B71424F9AA5D7BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064003031:1":{"text":"듣기로는 소고기랑 닭고기 중간이랬어...","source_cn":"听说介于牛肉和鸡肉之间……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x00AEE61D0BAB0608","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064003032:1":{"text":"그러면 조각내서 꼬치구이로 만들지. 그래야 맛을 온전히 느낄 수 있을 테니까.","source_cn":"既然如此，那就切块做成肉串。这样能品尝到它最原始的味道。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4C8EC30A7EE2BB9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064003033:1":{"text":"센시, 나도 자를래!","source_cn":"森西，我也要切！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC26827A2E4AA4A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064003034:1":{"text":"그럼 난 양념으로 쓸 솔트넛 가루를 준비하러 갈게.","source_cn":"那我去准备点盐津仁粉，作为撒料。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB12B8599E3C130AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064003035:1":{"text":"응... 그럼 난 느끼함을 잡을 수 있게 뱀뼈풀 물을 가져올게.","source_cn":"嗯……那我去弄点蛇骨草水来，给大家解腻。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAE491C20E0889352","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064003036:1":{"text":"뱀뼈풀... 식물이야? 나도 보고 싶어!","source_cn":"蛇骨草，是植物吗？我有点想看看！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x48150EE255B0E089","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064003037:1":{"text":"저랑 치피도 도울게요!","source_cn":"我和满满也去帮忙！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA339FD3ED0A42B1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064003038:1":{"text":"...또 나만 남은 거야?","source_cn":"……怎么又只剩下我了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xACF730C93407EB14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:57:1064003038":{"text":"...또 나만 남은 거야?","source_cn":"……怎么又只剩下我了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xACF730C93407EB14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064003039:1":{"text":"뭐라도 도울 일이 없나 찾아봐야겠네...","source_cn":"只能看看有没有什么力所能及的活了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x06982B819FA26DA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064003040:1":{"text":"음, 그럼 우리는 모닥불을 피우자. 어차피 필요하잖아.","source_cn":"唔，那我们去准备篝火吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC013779114FAB227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064003041:1":{"text":"그렇게 모두가 바쁘게 식사 준비를 했다.","source_cn":"就这样，大家热火朝天地忙了起来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x62A2FBEC449DA4E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064003042:1":{"text":"금세 <style=\"highlight\">솔트넛 모래 벌레 꼬치구이</style>와 <style=\"highlight\">아센 뱀뼈풀 물</style>이 완성되었다.","source_cn":"很快地，<style=highlight>盐津仁沙虫肉...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:62::2":{"text":"솔트넛 모래 벌레 꼬치 구이와 아센 뱀뼈풀 물","source_cn":"盐津仁沙虫肉串与荒角蛇骨草水","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BF1920F8017E516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064003043:0":{"text":"모래 벌레 요리는 처음이군. 다들 먹어보게나.","source_cn":"老夫也是第一次料理沙虫肉，各位先尝尝看吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4B84EE6F4FF6ACC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064003044:1":{"text":"음... 맛있어!","source_cn":"唔……好吃！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB5186E5231521044","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064003045:1":{"text":"겉은 바삭하고 속은 부드럽네! 소고기보다 달콤한데, 닭고기보다는 또 쫄깃해!","source_cn":"外脆里嫩，肉质紧实又多汁！越嚼越多汁。比牛肉多了一丝甜...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064003046:1":{"text":"아무리 생각해도 이상해. 벌레 고기에서 어떻게 닭고기랑 소고기 맛이 나는 거지...","source_cn":"怎么想都很奇怪？虫肉怎么会像鸡肉和牛肉……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5241D590BB4F31A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:71:1064003046":{"text":"아무리 생각해도 이상해. 벌레 고기에서 어떻게 닭고기랑 소고기 맛이 나는 거지...","source_cn":"怎么想都很奇怪？虫肉怎么会像鸡肉和牛肉……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5241D590BB4F31A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064003047:1":{"text":"..난 뱀뼈풀 물부터 마실래. 배고프면... 그때 먹을게!","source_cn":"……我还是先喝蛇骨草水吧。实在饿了……我再尝尝看！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x88C40CA90AF7BF6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1064003048:0":{"text":"고기는 뜨거울 때 먹어야 해.","source_cn":"肉要趁热吃。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD7200FF073DC78F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064003049:0":{"text":"윽, 알았어. 먹어보면 되잖아.","source_cn":"呜，我知道啦。我现在就吃——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x94BF7F85C75B0EEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1064003050:1":{"text":"맛, 맛있어! 입 안에서 사르르 녹는데 하나도 안 느끼해!","source_cn":"好、好吃！入口即化，但又不腻！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x95930FF7E0F8C962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1064003051:1":{"text":"모닥불 옆에서 먹는 꼬치구이라니... 이게 얼마만의 여유야.","source_cn":"在篝火旁吃肉串……好久没有那么悠闲了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6C21031F0F86B42B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064003052:1":{"text":"술 한 잔 하면 딱인데. 여긴 죄다 어린애들 뿐이네.","source_cn":"虽说这时候应该配上一杯酒，但这个部落里都是小孩子。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC814614C2857C31A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064003053:1":{"text":"애들한테 나쁜 버릇이 들게 할 수는 없지...","source_cn":"还是不要教坏他们了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA7987B6F6E802871","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:82:1064003054:1":{"text":"미궁에서도 이렇게 맛있는 음식을 먹을 수 있어?","source_cn":"你们在迷宫里也能吃到这么美味的食物吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBBD2E57766302896","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064003055:1":{"text":"당연하지. 센시만 있으면 돼!","source_cn":"当然了，这都多亏了森西！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x61E9C4A1DCB86140","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064003056:1":{"text":"나는 그저... 어디에 있든, 먹는 것이 가장 중요하다고 생각하는 것뿐이라네.","source_cn":"老夫只是觉得……无论身在哪里，吃好饭都是很重要的事情。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x48F58DED1C238222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:87:1064003057:1":{"text":"우리는 모닥불 옆에서 맛있는 음식과 함께, 밤 늦게까지 서로의 모험 이야기를 나누었다...","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:71:0:1":{"text":"먹어보면 알겠지. 일단 한 입 먹어봐.","source_cn":"尝了才知道，不如先试试？","status":"matched_run